The window-value reset sampler in src/supermimic/envs/mdp/reset_sampling.py
adapts the official ReturnSampler to clip-local bins, reset eligibility masks,
checkpoint validation, and this repository's collection lifecycle. The WM
normalization, LayerNorm block, analytic soft termination, actor normalization,
and critic upper-bound integration also follow the official implementation.
These adaptations are modified implementations, not an unmodified upstream copy.
